# Two-player HORSE (run horse2p SOMA: the fun word from data run.twoPlayer.horse.words) at the
# S.K.A.T.E. spot, S.K.A.T.E.'s rules between the players: player 1 sets first, the setter changes
# every round, a missed match is a letter. The bot rides player 1's turns clean (Kickflip, Heelflip,
# Pop Shove-It, FS 180) and player 2's sketchy: player 2 misses every match and every set (its
# Ollie): S-O-M-A in 11 turns of about 4.7 s (the 2 s pause and the ride), player 1 wins with none.
park soma
cmd 0 player2 join
cmd 0 run horse2p SOMA
bot horse kickflip,heelflip,popshoveit,fs180
p2 bot horse sketchy
run 6400
expect event horseStart{word=SOMA} within 1..1
expect event horseTurn{who=1,role=set,seconds=10} within 1..1
expect event horseSet{by=1,trick=kickflip,name=Kickflip} within 580..580
expect event horseTurn{who=2,role=match,trick=kickflip} within 580..580
expect event horseMatch{by=2,ok=false,trick=kickflip,got=kickflip,reason=sketchy} within 1149..1149
expect event horseLetter{who=2,letters=S} within 1149..1149
expect event horseTurn{who=2,role=set} within 1149..1149
expect event horseSetMiss{by=2,reason=sketchy,got=ollie} within 1718..1718
expect event horseTurn{who=1,role=set} within 1718..1718
expect event horseSet{by=1,trick=heelflip} within 2298..2298
expect event horseLetter{who=2,letters=SOM} within 4585..4585
expect event horseSet{by=1,trick=fs180,name=FS 180} within 5734..5734
expect event horseLetter{who=2,letters=SOMA} within 6303..6303
expect event horseOver{winner=1} within 6303..6303
expect event horseLetter{who=1} count == 0
expect event horseTurn count == 11
expect session.mode == over at end
expect session2.horseLetters == SOMA at end
expect no event bail
